# ===========================================================================
# PeopleCore / HRIS Software - local-development exclusions
#
# Anything matched below is INTERNAL ONLY. It must never be committed, pushed
# to a public repository, bundled into an npm/zip package, or otherwise
# included in a public distribution.
#
# Public surface is an allowlist - see EXPORT_MANIFEST.md:
#   index.html, landing.html, assets/screenshots/*.png
# ===========================================================================

